<title>SWITZERLAND: PRESS DIGEST - Switzerland - July 16.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Switzerland - July 16.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here are the highlights from Swiss newspapers on Wednesday:</p>
<p>TAGES ANZEIGER</p>
<p>The Swiss Bank Corporation (SBC) and the Long Term Credit Bank of Japan (LTCB) have signed a letter of intent to form a strategic alliance.</p>
<p>JOURNAL DE GENEVE</p>
<p>A group of Swiss scientist are mounting a campaign aimed at closing the loopholes in the country's laws governing genetic technology. The scientists intend to conduct a study and present their recommendations in the fall. -- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
